# 9. SHOW CARD MECHANIC

Before EVERY legal shot:

The player must reveal the poker card corresponding to the ball they intend to play.

The revealed card proves that the ball belongs to their current objective.

This is an essential gameplay mechanic.

The UI must clearly show:

* selected card
* selected ball
* relationship between card and ball
* current objective

