# 10. RANDOM CARD REVEAL FOR DUPLICATES

If a player has multiple cards representing the same ball:

show ONLY ONE of those cards.

Example:

Player owns:

A♠
A♥
A♦
A♣

When Ball 1 is pocketed:

show ONE Ace card.

Do NOT show all four Aces.

The displayed Ace can be selected randomly from the available equivalent cards.

Similarly:

5♦
5♣

When Ball 5 is pocketed:

show only one of:

5♦
5♣

Do NOT reveal both.

