# 12. FREE BALLS

Balls:

14
15

are FREE SHOT BALLS.

They are NOT assigned to any player.

Any player may legally pocket Ball 14 or Ball 15 according to the game mechanics.

Pocketing either:

Ball 14
OR
Ball 15

awards:

+1 extra shot

Implement this as a real gameplay mechanic.

Do not add Ball 14 or Ball 15 to player objectives.

Example:

Player legally pockets Ball 14.

Current turn continues with one additional shot.

